---
name: planner
description: Today's planner items. Only rendered when there are some.
template:
  format:
    kind: mustache
  parser:
    kind: prompty
inputs:
  items:
    kind: array
    description: "one line per item, \"09:30 Title [pending]\""
    example:
      - "09:30 File taxes [pending]"
---
Today's planner (use the planner tools to change it):
{{#items}}
- {{.}}
{{/items}}
